+# UI11 hand-back — 2026-10-06
+
+## Result
+
+Reduced the Dock artwork to 86% of its cropped source frame. Tests measure the signed mark inside a 76–85% tile-width band, verify the lower-right I.A signature is still present, and confirm the original burgundy color remains. The white rounded tile is unchanged.
+
+Replaced the detailed raster image in the menu bar with a native vector link symbol. The system symbol is rendered with the existing neutral grayscale glass gradient; the decision dot and edge remain neutral. Four snapshots cover Light/Graphite with and without the badge. Light/Graphite Dock snapshots were also regenerated and inspected.
+
+## Files
+
+- `app/Sources/BatonUI/Components/BrandMark.swift`
+- `app/Sources/BatonUI/Screens/Popover/PopoverView.swift`
+- `app/Tests/BatonUITests/BrandTests.swift`
+- `docs/plan/STATUS.md`
+- `docs/plan/track-d-app.md`
+- `docs/plan/reports/UI11-2026-10-06.md`
+
+## Checks
+
